{"strongs": "H6663", "word": "צָדֵק", "translit": "tsa.daq", "root": "צדק", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb denominative", "gloss": "be just, righteous", "definition": "[ צָדֵק , צָדֹק ] verb denominative be just, righteous ; — Qal Perfect 3 feminine singular צָֽדְקָה Isa 38:26 2 masculine singular צָדַקְתָּ Job 33:12 ; Job 35:7 etc.; Imperfect 3 masculine singular יִצְדַּק Job 9:2 +; יִצְדָּ֑ק Job 4:17 ; Job 11:2 3 feminine plural תִּצְדַּקְנָה Ezek 16:52 ( ᵐ5 Co תְּצַדְּקִין , not Berthol Toy Krae ), etc; — 1. have a just cause, be in the right , Job 9:15 ; Job 9:20 ; Job 13:18 ; Job 34:5 in complaint Job 33:12 with מִן person Gen 38:26 ( J ; of Tamar). 2. be justified , in one's plea Job 11:2 with עִם (man with God) Job 9:2 ; Job 25:4 ׳ בי Isa 45:25 by witnesses Isa 43:9 by acquittal Ps 143:2 ; Isa 43:26 by condemnation of opponent Job 40:8 . 3. be just: of God, in his government, in charging with sin Ps 51:6 of ׳ מִשְׁפְּטֵייֿ Ps 19:10 . 4. be just, righteous , in conduct and character: of men Job 10:15 ; Job 15:14 ; Job 22:3 ; Job 35:7 , with מִן compare, Job 4:17 (more than God; Dr at God's hand , מִן 2 d ), Ezek 16:52 (< ᵐ5 Co Pi`el ). Niph`al Perfect 3 masculine singular וְנִצְדַּק קֹדֶשׁ consecutive Dan 8:14 the holy place shall be put right , in a right condition ( Marti Kau Buhl SS ; Bev Dr Marti Comm. be justified , its cause vindicated). Pi`el Perfect 3 feminine singular צִדְּקָה Jer 3:11 Imperfect 2 feminine singular תְּצַדְּקִי Ezek 16:51 Infinitive construct suffix צַדְּקֶ֑ךָּ Job 33:32 צַדֶּקְתֵּךְ ( Ges «GKC:52p»§ 52p ) Ezek 16:52 צַדְּקוֺ Job 32:2 — justify: עַל צַדְּקוֺ נַפְשׁוֺ מֵאֱלֹהִים Job 32:2 because he justified himself rather than God (compare Qal 1 ); make to appear righteous Jer 3:11 ; Ezek 16:51 ; Ezek 16:52 (all with מִן compare); חָפַצְתִּי צַדְּקֶ֑ךָּ Job 33:32 I desire to justify thee (in thy plea, compare Qal 2 ). Hiph`il Perfect 1 singular suffix הִצְדַּקְתִּיו 2Sam 15:4 3 masculine plural הִצְדִּיקוּ Deut 25:1 Imperfect 3 masculine singular יַצְדִּיק Isa 53:11 1 singular אַצְדִּיק Exod 23:7 ; Job 27:5 Infinitive construct הַצְדִּיק 1Kgs 8:32 = 2Chr 6:23 Imperative masculine plural הַצְדִּיקוּ Ps 82:3 Participle מַצְדִּיק Prov 17:15 , etc.; — 1. do justice , in administering law 2Sam 15:4 ; Ps 82:3 . 2. declare righteous, justify , with accusative (ה)צַדִּיק Deut 25:1 ; 1Kgs 8:32 = 2Chr 6:23 רָשָׁע Exod 23:7 ( E ) Isa 5:23 ; Prov 17:15 Justify accusers, by recognizing charge as just Job 27:5 . 3. justify, vindicate the cause of, save , with accusative, Isa 50:8 (of God), with לְ of object Isa 53:11 (of servant of ׳ י ). 4. make righteous, turn to righteousness , Dan 12:3 , compare Aboth Dan 5:26 ; Dan 5:27 Bev . Hithpa`el Imperfect 1 plural נִצְטַדָּ֑ק Gen 44:16 ( J ) how shall we justify ourselves , clear ourselves from suspicion?", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6943')\">BDB6943</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H6663')\">H6663</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6942')\">BDB6942</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6944')\">BDB6944</entry></div><p> [<bdbheb>צָדֵק</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>צָדֹק</bdbheb>] <b>verb denominative</b> <highlightword>be just, righteous</highlightword>; — <div class=\"point\"><b>Qal</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> 3 feminine singular <bdbheb>צָֽדְקָה</bdbheb> <checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"Isa 38:26\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(23,38,26)\">Isa 38:26</ref> 2 masculine singular <bdbheb>צָדַקְתָּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 33:12\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(18,33,12)\">Job 33:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 35:7\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(18,35,7)\">Job 35:7</ref> etc.; <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbheb>יִצְדַּק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 9:2\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(18,9,2)\">Job 9:2</ref> +; <bdbheb>יִצְדָּ֑ק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 4:17\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(18,4,17)\">Job 4:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 11:2\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(18,11,2)\">Job 11:2</ref> 3 feminine plural <bdbheb>תִּצְדַּקְנָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 16:52\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"52\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"52\" onclick=\"bcv(26,16,52)\">Ezek 16:52</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Co')\">Co</lookup> <bdbheb>תְּצַדְּקִין</bdbheb>, not <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Berthol')\">Berthol</lookup> Toy <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Krae')\">Krae</lookup>), etc; — </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>have a just cause, be in the right</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Job 9:15\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(18,9,15)\">Job 9:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 9:20\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(18,9,20)\">Job 9:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 13:18\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(18,13,18)\">Job 13:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 34:5\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(18,34,5)\">Job 34:5</ref> in complaint <ref ref=\"Job 33:12\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(18,33,12)\">Job 33:12</ref> with <bdbheb>מִן</bdbheb> person <ref ref=\"Gen 38:26\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(1,38,26)\">Gen 38:26</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>; of Tamar). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>be justified</highlight>, in one's plea <ref ref=\"Job 11:2\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(18,11,2)\">Job 11:2</ref> with <bdbheb>עִם</bdbheb> (man with God) <ref ref=\"Job 9:2\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(18,9,2)\">Job 9:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 25:4\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(18,25,4)\">Job 25:4</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 45:25\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(23,45,25)\">Isa 45:25</ref> by witnesses <ref ref=\"Isa 43:9\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"43\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"43\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(23,43,9)\">Isa 43:9</ref> by acquittal <ref ref=\"Ps 143:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"143\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"143\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,143,2)\">Ps 143:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 43:26\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"43\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"43\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(23,43,26)\">Isa 43:26</ref> by condemnation of opponent <ref ref=\"Job 40:8\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(18,40,8)\">Job 40:8</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <highlight>be just:</highlight> of God, in his government, in charging with sin <ref ref=\"Ps 51:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,51,6)\">Ps 51:6</ref> of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מִשְׁפְּטֵייֿ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 19:10\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(19,19,10)\">Ps 19:10</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> <highlight>be just, righteous</highlight>, in conduct and character: of men <ref ref=\"Job 10:15\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(18,10,15)\">Job 10:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 15:14\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(18,15,14)\">Job 15:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 22:3\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(18,22,3)\">Job 22:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 35:7\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(18,35,7)\">Job 35:7</ref>, with <bdbheb>מִן</bdbheb> compare, <ref ref=\"Job 4:17\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(18,4,17)\">Job 4:17</ref> (more than God; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr</lookup> <highlight>at God's hand</highlight>, <bdbheb>מִן</bdbheb> <b>2 d</b>), <ref ref=\"Ezek 16:52\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"52\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"52\" onclick=\"bcv(26,16,52)\">Ezek 16:52</ref> (&lt; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Co')\">Co</lookup> <b>Pi`el</b>). <b>Niph`al</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbheb>וְנִצְדַּק קֹדֶשׁ</bdbheb> consecutive <ref ref=\"Dan 8:14\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(27,8,14)\">Dan 8:14</ref> <highlight>the holy place shall be put right</highlight>, in a right condition (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Marti')\">Marti<sup>Kau</sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Buhl')\">Buhl</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('SS')\">SS</lookup>; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Bev')\">Bev</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Marti')\">Marti<sup>Comm.</sup></lookup> <highlight>be justified</highlight>, its cause vindicated). <b>Pi`el</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> 3 feminine singular <bdbheb>צִדְּקָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 3:11\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(24,3,11)\">Jer 3:11</ref> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> 2 feminine singular <bdbheb>תְּצַדְּקִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 16:51\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"51\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"51\" onclick=\"bcv(26,16,51)\">Ezek 16:51</ref> <highlight>Infinitive construct</highlight> suffix <bdbheb>צַדְּקֶ֑ךָּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 33:32\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(18,33,32)\">Job 33:32</ref> <bdbheb>צַדֶּקְתֵּךְ</bdbheb> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ges')\">Ges</lookup><sup>«GKC:52p»§ 52p</sup>) <ref ref=\"Ezek 16:52\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"52\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"52\" onclick=\"bcv(26,16,52)\">Ezek 16:52</ref> <bdbheb>צַדְּקוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 32:2\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(18,32,2)\">Job 32:2</ref> — <highlight>justify:</highlight> <bdbheb>עַל צַדְּקוֺ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>נַפְשׁוֺ מֵאֱלֹהִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 32:2\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(18,32,2)\">Job 32:2</ref> <highlight>because he justified himself rather than God</highlight> (compare <b>Qal 1</b>); <highlight>make to appear righteous</highlight> <ref ref=\"Jer 3:11\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(24,3,11)\">Jer 3:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 16:51\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"51\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"51\" onclick=\"bcv(26,16,51)\">Ezek 16:51</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 16:52\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"52\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"52\" onclick=\"bcv(26,16,52)\">Ezek 16:52</ref> (all with <bdbheb>מִן</bdbheb> compare); <bdbheb>חָפַצְתִּי צַדְּקֶ֑ךָּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 33:32\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(18,33,32)\">Job 33:32</ref> <highlight>I desire to justify thee</highlight> (in thy plea, compare <b>Qal 2</b>). <b>Hiph`il</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> 1 singular suffix <bdbheb>הִצְדַּקְתִּיו</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 15:4\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(10,15,4)\">2Sam 15:4</ref> 3 masculine plural <bdbheb>הִצְדִּיקוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 25:1\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(5,25,1)\">Deut 25:1</ref> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbheb>יַצְדִּיק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 53:11\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"53\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"53\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(23,53,11)\">Isa 53:11</ref> 1 singular <bdbheb>אַצְדִּיק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 23:7\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(2,23,7)\">Exod 23:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 27:5\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(18,27,5)\">Job 27:5</ref> <highlight>Infinitive construct</highlight> <bdbheb>הַצְדִּיק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 8:32\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(11,8,32)\">1Kgs 8:32</ref> = <ref ref=\"2Chr 6:23\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(14,6,23)\">2Chr 6:23</ref> <highlight>Imperative</highlight> masculine plural <bdbheb>הַצְדִּיקוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 82:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"82\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"82\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,82,3)\">Ps 82:3</ref> <highlight>Participle</highlight> <bdbheb>מַצְדִּיק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 17:15\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(20,17,15)\">Prov 17:15</ref>, etc.; — </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>do justice</highlight>, in administering law <ref ref=\"2Sam 15:4\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(10,15,4)\">2Sam 15:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 82:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"82\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"82\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,82,3)\">Ps 82:3</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>declare righteous, justify</highlight>, with accusative <bdbheb>(ה)צַדִּיק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 25:1\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(5,25,1)\">Deut 25:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 8:32\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(11,8,32)\">1Kgs 8:32</ref> = <ref ref=\"2Chr 6:23\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(14,6,23)\">2Chr 6:23</ref> <bdbheb>רָשָׁע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 23:7\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(2,23,7)\">Exod 23:7</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>) <ref ref=\"Isa 5:23\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(23,5,23)\">Isa 5:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 17:15\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(20,17,15)\">Prov 17:15</ref> <highlight>Justify</highlight> accusers, by recognizing charge as just <ref ref=\"Job 27:5\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(18,27,5)\">Job 27:5</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <highlight>justify, vindicate the cause of, save</highlight>, with accusative, <ref ref=\"Isa 50:8\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(23,50,8)\">Isa 50:8</ref> (of God), with <bdbheb>לְ</bdbheb> of object <ref ref=\"Isa 53:11\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"53\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"53\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(23,53,11)\">Isa 53:11</ref> (of servant of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> <highlight>make righteous, turn to righteousness</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Dan 12:3\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(27,12,3)\">Dan 12:3</ref>, compare Aboth <ref ref=\"Dan 5:26\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(27,5,26)\">Dan 5:26</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 5:27\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(27,5,27)\">Dan 5:27</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Bev')\">Bev</lookup>. <b>Hithpa`el</b> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> 1 plural <bdbheb>נִצְטַדָּ֑ק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 44:16\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(1,44,16)\">Gen 44:16</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>) how <highlight>shall we justify ourselves</highlight>, clear ourselves from suspicion? </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Isa 38:26", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 38, "verse": 26}, {"raw": "Job 33:12", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 33, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Job 35:7", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 35, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Job 9:2", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 9, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Job 4:17", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 4, "verse": 17}, {"raw": "Job 11:2", "bo